The intent audit exposed one issue worth repairing before status selection: the prompt defines a rotation of the alphabet but does not authorize changing non-alphabet characters. Following the Kit’s contract rule for alphabet transformations, I’m making non-lowercase characters pass through unchanged and extending the same unbounded proof to that branch. This strengthens Gate B alignment without narrowing the domain.
apply patch
